[ ] Rewrite the Radicale and vdirsyncer cookbook for unattended service =cookbook-unattended-sync $Replace the patterns in docs/cookbook/radicale-vdirsyncer.md that silently break unattended sync with the setup that works: a systemd-creds credential for vdirsyncer, separate clearhead-sync and vdirsyncer units on staggered OnCalendar timers, and OnFailure hooks that treat exit 2 as a decision to make, not a failure.$ !3 ^2026-09-24T22:47 <urn\:uuid\:01a1a57e-d20e-72c1-92b2-599cce9797ea #01a0d71a-88a1-7319-b7f2-0b7964cfb13a
