[ ] Scaffold the union merge driver for completed actions =completed-union-merge $Have clearhead init write .clearhead/.gitattributes containing *.completed.actions merge=union next to the .gitignore it already writes. It must never cover next.actions. Add the same file to the remaining platform submodules that have a .clearhead.$ !3 ^2026-09-25T16:00 #01a0dacc-c415-70c0-9bdd-d4ac4302097c
