[ ] Move an action to another charter =move-action-between-charters $No verb moves an action between charters keeping its id; update action --charter only scopes the lookup. A move should carry the line, its children and its sidecar state, keeping the UUID.$ !3 ^2026-09-25T16:51 #01a0dafb-2037-7302-8099-77a95be083b8
