[ ] Report E004 and E005 by code, and keep recovered reads from inventing parent links =report-hierarchy-codes $A child marker at the top level (E004) or a skipped level (E005) is reported as a generic syntax-error 'unexpected token', though linting.md names both codes. Report them by code with the offending line. Also, recover-mode reads, LSP and doctor take parent links from tree-sitter's error recovery, which can change with any grammar edit: treat an action recovered inside an ERROR node as having no parent. Split from merge-actions core-error-structure, 2026-11-26.$ !4 ^2026-11-26T00:44 #01a2154f-ac60-7890-a2d2-01e0677a6817
